{"id":"f885c5ca-9380-4133-a44c-74fe98e43cfe","revision":0,"last_node_id":20,"last_link_id":13,"nodes":[{"id":9,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-3180,4520],"size":[400,360],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"怎么改的","properties":{},"widgets_values":["# 基础出图练习 · FLUX.2（已按官方链路改好）\n\n你原来的骨架对，配件错了。这次改了 4 处：\n\n1. **CLIP** → `mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16`，类型 **flux2**（不要 qwen3vl，那是 H3 视频的）\n2. **空 Latent** → `EmptyFlux2LatentImage`（Flux.2 是 128 通道，SD 的空 Latent 是 4 通道）\n3. **引导** → `FluxGuidance 3.5`，不再用 KSampler cfg=8，也不用 AuraFlow\n4. **采样** → euler + `Flux2Scheduler` 20 步（官方推荐）\n\n负向提示词 Flux.2 基本不用，已拿掉。画幅先 **1920×1088 / 1 张**（对齐后面 H3）。要更省显存改成 1280×768。\n\n**怎么跑**：Load 本文件 → 点运行。只改中间正向提示词即可。\n"],"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"},{"id":1,"type":"UNETLoader","pos":[-2750,4546],"size":[340,90],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"UNet名称","name":"unet_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"unet_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"数据类型","name":"weight_dtype","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"weight_dtype"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"模型","name":"MODEL","type":"MODEL","slot_index":0,"links":[3]}],"title":"UNet · flux2_dev_fp8mixed","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"UNETLoader"},"widgets_values":["flux2_dev_fp8mixed.safetensors","default"]},{"id":6,"type":"CLIPLoader","pos":[-2750,4696],"size":[340,118],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP名称","name":"clip_name","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"clip_name"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"类型","name":"type","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"type"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"设备","name":"device","shape":7,"type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"device"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"CLIP","name":"CLIP","type":"CLIP","slot_index":0,"links":[1]}],"title":"CLIP · mistral flux2（不是 qwen）","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"CLIPLoader"},"widgets_values":["mistral_3_small_flux2_bf16.safetensors","flux2","default"]},{"id":8,"type":"VAELoader",